msgid "A rough shift: it doesn't count toward your next promotion."
msgstr "这班做得不太好：不计入升职所需的班数。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A second stock location"
msgstr "第二个库存地点"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A segment groups transactions from one industry."
msgstr "分部汇整同一产业的交易。"

#: data/jobs/parcel_sorter.json
