msgstr "最好的一张会放上商品页。照片品质会影响买的人数。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The big deal didn't go ahead. Growth that kills you isn't growth."
msgstr "这笔大交易没有成。会把你拖垮的成长，不算成长。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The boxes are stuck at sea."
msgstr "货卡在海上。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The bridge is frozen"
msgstr "跨链桥冻结了"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:151
msgid "The bridge is frozen until %s."
msgstr "跨链桥冻结，预计 %s 恢复。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_reopened.json
msgid "The bridge is open again, with limits and an insurance pool. Ninety cents on the dollar isn't nothing. It isn't a dollar either."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了，有限额，也有保险基金。拿回九成不是没有，但也不是全部。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:389
msgid "The bridge is open again, with limits and an insurance pool. Wires never stopped, so you lost nothing but a week of options. Split your payments across rails, and keep a wire route warm."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了，有限额，也有保险基金。电汇从没停过，你只是少了一周的选择，没有损失。付款要分散在不同管道，电汇这条路也要维持畅通。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:385
msgid "The bridge is open again."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:387
msgid "The bridge is open again. Frozen balances came back at %d cents on the dollar: %s of your %s. The attacker drained the rest before the freeze. The operators' reserve and insurance pool covered everyone else's share, and nobody covers the gap."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。冻结的余额按 %d%% 返还：你的 %s 拿回 %s。其余的在冻结前就被黑客搬走了。营运方的准备金和保险基金补了大家的份，缺口没有人负责。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:257 scripts/sim/rails.gd:315
msgid "The bridge isn't frozen."
msgstr "跨链桥没有冻结。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:384
msgid "The bridge reopened. Frozen balances came back at %s on the dollar."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。冻结的余额以 %s 的比例返还。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The bridge under our rail was exploited. Transfers crossing it are frozen."
msgstr "我们管道底下的跨链桥被骇了，经过它的转帐全被冻结。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:181
msgid "The bridge was already hit."
msgstr "跨链桥已经被骇过了。"

#: scripts/sim/real_estate.gd:71
msgid "The brokerage closed during this viewing."
msgstr "带看期间仲介公司已关闭。"

#: scripts/sim/real_estate.gd:20
msgid "The brokerage is already open."
msgstr "仲介店已开业。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:55
msgid "The business closed during the course."
msgstr "课程期间公司已关闭。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:567
msgid "The business closed during the negotiation."
msgstr "谈判期间公司已关闭。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/auction_game.gd:26
msgid "The buyer fee is added to the hammer price. Hidden defects are not shown unless Jun inspected the car."
msgstr "买方手续费加在落槌价上。除非 Jun 验过车，否则不会显示隐藏瑕疵。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The buyer fee is added to the price. Stop bidding when the price passes what the car is worth to you."
msgstr "买方手续费加在价格上。价格超过这辆车对你的价值就停手。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The buyer pays a percentage of the contract before delivery; the remainder follows the payment terms."
msgstr "买方在交货前先付合约金额的一部分，余款依票期支付。"

#: data/events/media_client.json
msgid "The campaign stops. The unused advance is refunded and your reputation takes a hit."
msgstr "活动停止。未使用的预付款退还，你的声誉会受损。"

#: data/events/automotive_flood.json
msgid "The car is priced as a flood car; no claims will follow."
msgstr "这辆车以泡水车定价，之后不会有求偿。"

#: data/dialogue/owen_blake_intro.json
msgid "The catch is that those rooms are gone, even if a festival suddenly doubles demand. Read the calendar before you say yes."
msgstr "代价是那些房间卖掉了，就算突然有活动让需求翻倍也一样。答应之前先看日历。"

#: data/events/media_price.json
msgid "The channels agreed a locked rate: only half the increase applies for two weeks."
msgstr "各频道同意锁定费率：两周内只适用一半的涨幅。"

#: data/events/energy_subsidy_cut.json
msgid "The city is halving solar grants. File rush paperwork for applications still in the queue, or accept the lower rate."
msgstr "市府要把太阳能补助砍半。可以为排队中的申请付急件费，或接受较低的比例。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The city map"
msgstr "城市地图"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The city passed the Clean Packaging Act: read the news board"
msgstr "市府通过《洁净包装法》：去看看新闻看板"

#: scripts/ui/energy_ui.gd:34
msgid "The client declined this quote. Improve payback or the price."
msgstr "客户拒绝了这份报价。请改善回本期或价格。"

#: data/events/media_client.json
msgid "The client left. The remaining media plan was cancelled and the unused advance refunded."
msgstr "客户离开了。剩余的媒体计划已取消，未使用的预付款已退还。"

#: scripts/sim/freelance_workflow.gd:32
msgid "The client rejected this quote. Lower it or build your reputation."
msgstr "客户拒绝这份报价，请降低报价或累积口碑。"

#: data/events/media_client.json
msgid "The client stayed after the discount. The campaign carries on."
msgstr "客户因折扣留了下来。活动继续进行。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The clock keeps running while you're at the computer, just like in real life. Buying, listing and working also take their own time."
msgstr "用电脑时时间照样在走，跟现实一样。进货、上架、工作也各自要花时间。"

#: scripts/sim/company.gd:103
msgid "The company belongs to Hale Group now: no money moves between it and you."
msgstr "公司现在属于 Hale Group：你和公司之间不能再转帐。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/insolvency_modal.gd:11
msgid "The company can't pay its debts"
msgstr "公司付不出债务"

#: scripts/sim/contracts.gd:82
msgid "The company closed. This unanswered offer was withdrawn."
msgstr "公司结束营业，尚未回复的报价已撤回。"

#: scripts/sim/contracts.gd:88
msgid "The company closed. This undelivered contract was terminated with no additional penalty."
msgstr "公司结束营业，未交货合约已终止，不另收违约金。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/insolvency_modal.gd:37
msgid "The company is solvent again. Your savings took the hit."
msgstr "公司恢复偿债能力了，代价是你的积蓄。"

#: scripts/ui/automotive_ui.gd:200
msgid "The counter costs %s per month. Lease it at Gateway Car Rental in the Airport district."
msgstr "柜台每月租金 %s。请到机场区的 Gateway 租车承租。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The days between paying a supplier and the stock reaching your shelf."
msgstr "从付款给供应商到货品上架之间的天数。"

#: scripts/sim/lease_end.gd:60
msgid "The destination has insufficient room for stock and incoming deliveries."
msgstr "目的地空间不足，无法容纳库存与预计到货。"

#: scripts/sim/lease_end.gd:64
msgid "The destination has insufficient staff capacity."
msgstr "目的地没有足够的员工空间。"

#: data/dialogue/victor_sold.json
msgid "The difference: the profit is mine, and the mistakes are ours. Don't waste the head start."
msgstr "差别是：获利归我，错误一起扛。别浪费先发优势。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:202
msgid "The digital-dollar bridge was exploited. Transfers are frozen until about %s."
msgstr "数字美元跨链桥遭骇。转帐冻结，预计 %s 前后恢复。"

#: scripts/sim/logistics.gd:532
msgid "The driver"
msgstr "司机"

#: scripts/sim/acquisition.gd:147
msgid "The earn-out did not pay: revenue fell short of the agreed floor."
msgstr "绩效尾款没有付：营收低于约定的下限。"

#: scripts/sim/staff.gd:61
msgid "The employer registration fee is %s."
msgstr "雇主登记费是 %s。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:34
msgid "The energy business is already open."
msgstr "能源事业已经开办。"

#: data/events/shipment_lost.json
msgid "The escrow contract returned your money. The fee is not refunded."
msgstr "托管合约把钱退给你了。手续费不退。"

#: data/events/hotel_event_cancelled.json
msgid "The event leaves the calendar and group deposits are refunded."
msgstr "活动从日历上移除，团体订金全数退还。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The existing liquidation pays 80% of receivables once. The closed company cannot collect again or use your new company stock; old contracts remain visible as records."
msgstr "清算一次回收应收帐款的 80%。已关闭公司不能再收一次钱，也不能使用新公司的库存；旧合约仍保留供查阅。"

#: scripts/sim/manufacturing.gd:27
msgid "The factory is already open."
msgstr "工厂已开业。"

#: data/events/manufacturing_cancel.json data/events/manufacturing_recall.json data/events/manufacturing_shortage.json
msgid "The factory ledger and schedule have been updated."
msgstr "工厂帐本和调度已更新。"

#: autoload/save_system.gd:406
msgid "The file could not be read. Your existing save is unchanged."
msgstr "无法读取文件。原有存盘仍完整保留。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/parcel_sort_game.gd:30
msgid "The first parcels show the district name. Later ones only have a postcode, and halfway through the cheat sheet goes away."
msgstr "前几个包裹会写区名，后面只有邮递区号；做到一半，小抄还会被收走。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:101
msgid "The fit-out costs %s."
msgstr "装修要 %s。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/company_os.gd:1252
msgid "The fitters start tonight. Ready %s."
msgstr "装修师傅今晚开工，%s 完工。"

#: data/events/hotel_event_cancelled.json
msgid "The flash sale refills some rooms for a week. Group deposits are refunded."
msgstr "限时特卖让部分房间在一周内重新卖出，团体订金全数退还。"

#: scripts/sim/company.gd:137
msgid "The grant opens with the Green Shift."
msgstr "补助要等绿色转型才开放。"

#: data/events/energy_tariff.json
msgid "The grid raised commercial tariffs by 25%. Hold your prices and take the margin hit, or pass the cost on to drivers."
msgstr "电网把商用电价调涨 25%。可以维持售价承受毛利冲击，或把成本转嫁给车主。"

#: scripts/ui/hotel_ui.gd:280
msgid "The group Campaign Mixer can run an internal hotel campaign at media cost; measured conversions lift real demand for a few days."
msgstr "集团的广告活动配置可以用媒体成本替旅馆投放内部广告；有成效的转换会让真实需求提高几天。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:103
msgid "The hotel is already at its largest size."
msgstr "旅馆已经是最大规模。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:41
msgid "The hotel is already open."
msgstr "旅馆已经开业。"

#: data/events/automotive_claim.json
msgid "The insurer disputes a $3,200 accident repair on one of your rental cars. Pay it yourself, fight it with a lawyer, or settle for half."
msgstr "保险公司对你一辆租赁车 $3,200 的事故维修有争议。可自己付、请律师打官司，或半价和解。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The interest costs far less than missing payroll or rent. Repay it as soon as the money arrives."
msgstr "利息远比发不出薪水或付不出房租便宜。钱一到就还掉。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:565
msgid "The landlord asked you to come back tomorrow."
msgstr "地主请你明天再来谈。"

#: scripts/ui/energy_ui.gd:35
msgid "The landlord declined. Try again tomorrow."
msgstr "地主拒绝了。明天再试。"

#: scripts/sim/living.gd:82
msgid "The landlord needs a registered company on the lease."
msgstr "房东要求用登记过的公司签租约。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The ledger averages what you paid for the units of a product at a stock location."
msgstr "帐本依同一存放地点的商品进价，计算每件平均成本。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:127 scripts/sim/compliance.gd:95
msgid "The licence fee is %s."
msgstr "执照费是 %s。"

#: data/events/hotel_equipment_failure.json
msgid "The lift and the hot water have broken in the same week."
msgstr "电梯与热水在同一周坏了。"

#: data/events/low_cash_warning.json
msgid "The liquidator's van is on its way."
msgstr "清仓商的货车在路上了。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The litres you burn follow the kilometres you drive, and wear and tear add a little more on every kilometre."
msgstr "用油的公升数跟着开的公里数走，每公里的耗损还要再多算一点。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The longer it is, the earlier you must reorder, or you run out and lose sales."
msgstr "交期越长，就要越早补货，不然缺货就会少卖。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The monthly share of subscribers expected to leave your SaaS product. Features and support help them stay."
msgstr "每月预期离开 SaaS 产品的订户比例；功能与客服有助留住订户。"

#: scripts/sim/manufacturing.gd:267
msgid "The mould is already paid for."
msgstr "已支付模具费。"

#: autoload/scene_router.gd:82
msgid "The new game could not be started because no save slot was available."
msgstr "没有可用的存盘字段，无法开始新游戏。"

#: scripts/sim/lease_end.gd:116
msgid "The notice period has not ended yet. Keep using the premises until the exit date."
msgstr "通知期尚未结束，退租日期前仍可使用处所。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_bridge.json
msgid "The operators are tracing the funds. I never asked anyone to trust me blindly. I asked them to trust code. Code has authors, and authors make mistakes."
msgstr "营运方正在追踪资金。我从没要求谁盲目相信我，我要的是他们相信代码。代码有作者，作者会犯错。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The operators say {ratio} of frozen balances will come back. The attacker took the rest."
msgstr "营运方说冻结的余额会回来 {ratio}，其余的被黑客拿走了。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The order you visit the stops in. The shortest round trip is rarely the order on the client's list."
msgstr "你走访各停靠点的顺序。最短的来回路线，通常不是客户清单上的顺序。"

#: data/events/hotel_event_cancelled.json
msgid "The organisers cancelled the next big city event. Group guests are leaving."
msgstr "主办单位取消了下一场城市大型活动，团体客人要退订。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/pack_game.gd:241
msgid "The other %d orders use skilled automatic packing."
msgstr "其余 %d 张订单采熟练自动装箱规则。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The packing table"
msgstr "打包桌"

#: scripts/sim/automotive.gd:371
msgid "The parking lot is full."
msgstr "停车场已满。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The payment is stuck: talk to Lina Zhao at Nexus Bank (weekdays 10–16)"
msgstr "款项卡住了：到 Nexus 银行找 Lina Zhao（平日 10–16 点）"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The payment still hasn't landed."
msgstr "那笔钱还是没到。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The permit screen lists the next missing step. Switching packaging alone is not enough without a green product on sale."
msgstr "许可画面会列出下一个缺少的步骤；只有换包材、没有贩售绿色商品仍不符合。"

#: scripts/ui/media_ui.gd:29
msgid "The pitch lost. Review creative fit before the next proposal."
msgstr "提案未得标。下次提案前请检查创意是否符合客群。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The price one of your businesses charges another for goods or services inside the group."
msgstr "集团内，一个事业向另一个事业收取商品或服务的价格。"

#: data/events/hotel_slump.json
msgid "The promotion softens the dip for two weeks, then it fades."
msgstr "促销能在两周内减缓低迷，之后效果消退。"

#: scripts/sim/company.gd:58
msgid "The registration fee is %s."
msgstr "登记规费是 %s。"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:722 scripts/sim/hotel.gd:723
msgid "The renovated %s rooms are back on sale."
msgstr "翻新完成的%s重新开卖。"

#: data/events/automotive_flood.json
msgid "The repair removes most of the damage but costs money and workshop days."
msgstr "修复能去除大部分损坏，但要花钱和工作天。"

#: scripts/sim/phone_messages.gd:61
msgid "The reply deadline has passed. Review the outcome in this thread."
msgstr "回复期限已过。请在对话串查看结果。"

#: scripts/sim/phone_messages.gd:181
msgid "The reply is no longer available. Review current Tasks or book a new time from Contacts."
msgstr "此回复已失效。请查看目前任务，或从联系人重新预约。"

#: data/events/hotel_review_storm.json
msgid "The review stays heavy until fresh reviews dilute it."
msgstr "这则评价会一直很有分量，直到新评价把它稀释。"

#: data/help/help.json scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:39
msgid "The river can only be crossed at a bridge. Undo takes the last stop back; the route is drawn as you go."
msgstr "过河只能走桥。「收回」会取消最后一个停靠点；路线会随着你的点击画出来。"

#: scripts/sim/energy.gd:119
msgid "The roof load limit allows fewer panels."
msgstr "屋顶承重上限不能放这么多面板。"

#: data/dialogue/sam_owner.json
msgid "The runs are posted every morning. Plan the route before you turn the key: every kilometre you don't drive is money you keep."
msgstr "外送单每天早上上架。发动前先排好路线：少开的每一公里，都是你留下的钱。"

#: scripts/sim/automotive.gd:233
msgid "The sale fell through: not enough cash or lot space."
msgstr "交易失败：现金或车场空间不足。"

#: scripts/sim/real_estate.gd:186
msgid "The sale would not cover the mortgage and the company cannot pay the shortfall. Raise cash or wait for prices to recover."
msgstr "这笔出售无法还清房贷，公司也付不起差额。请先筹措现金，或等房价回升。"

#: autoload/save_system.gd:189 autoload/save_system.gd:320
msgid "The save could not be written. Your existing save is unchanged."
msgstr "无法写入存盘。原有存盘仍完整保留。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The share of payments on a payment route that landed on time. It moves when something goes wrong on the route, and recovers slowly as payments land."
msgstr "某条付款管道上，准时到帐的款项所占的比例。管道出事时会下降，之后随着款项陆续到帐慢慢回升。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/parcel_sort_game.gd:102
msgid "The shift lead took the postcode sheet. From memory now!"
msgstr "组长把邮递区号表收走了，现在要靠记忆！"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:145
msgid "The shortest way there is. Textbook."
msgstr "这就是最短的路线，教科书等级。"

#: scripts/sim/automotive.gd:675
msgid "The showroom does not have room for that many cars."
msgstr "展示中心放不下那么多车。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The smallest quantity a supplier will sell you in one order."
msgstr "供应商一次最少要卖给你的数量。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The stars customers give your café. They drift toward how each day felt: queues, running out, prices and service."
msgstr "客人给你的咖啡店打的星等，会慢慢反映每天的体验：排队、缺货、价格和服务。"

#: data/events/energy_vandal.json
msgid "The station is back in three days."
msgstr "充电站三天后恢复营运。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The steady cost of following the rules: filings, checks and the person who keeps them in order."
msgstr "遵守规定的固定成本：申报、审查，还有负责把这些整理好的人。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:154
msgid "The storeroom can't take that much."
msgstr "储藏室放不下这么多。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The story so far ends here. Aurelia keeps going."
msgstr "故事到这里告一段落，Aurelia 仍继续运转。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The supplier normally deducts 15% of the original purchase value on a return. Aurelia Makers charges no cancellation or restocking fee."
msgstr "退货通常扣除原进货金额的 15%。Aurelia Makers 不收取消或退货手续费。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The supplier offer estimates the share of incoming units that may be unusable. The actual receipt can differ."
msgstr "供应商报价中的瑕疵率是预估无法使用的比例，实际收货结果可能不同。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "The supplier ships sooner because a bank stands behind you. It costs a fee, but protects both sides."
msgstr "有银行做担保，供应商会更快出货。要付手续费，但买卖双方都有保障。"

#: data/events/shipment_lost.json
msgid "The supplier will ship again. Expect it {days} days late."
msgstr "供应商会重新出货，预计晚 {days} 天到。"

#: data/events/hotel_strike.json
msgid "The team stays and no rooms are lost."
msgstr "团队留下来，没有任何房间受影响。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The teller is open weekdays 9 to 16. Loans are at the manager's desk."
msgstr "柜台平日 9 点到 16 点营业。贷款请找经理。"

#: scripts/world/actions.gd:102
msgid "The teller window is closed."
msgstr "柜台窗口已关闭。"

#: data/help/patch_notes.json
msgid "The tutorial recovers pending stock deliveries in older saves, keeps your day pass, and continues from the step you reached."
msgstr "旧存盘教学能补送尚未到达的货、保留日票，并从原本的步骤继续。"

#: scripts/sim/cafe.gd:98
msgid "The unit is already fitted out."
msgstr "店面已经装修好了。"

